cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study's adapters, runs, scores or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Fine-tuning for image-to-PlantUML: Qwen3.5 at 2B, 9B and 27B"
abstract: >-
  Qwen3.5-2B, 9B and 27B are fine-tuned with one fixed LoRA recipe on 20,000 rendered
  real-world PlantUML diagrams, and the published image-to-PlantUML benchmark is run before and
  after on its 1,000 test diagrams, each size against itself. The release holds the code, the
  frozen key lists, every test-set and dev-set run with its scores, and the tables; the adapters
  are on Hugging Face.
